# Anchored to the repo root, and deliberately: git sets core.ignorecase=true
# on macOS, so an unanchored `MANIFEST` also ignored the Rust directory
# module `core/src/vault/manifest/` (#564). setuptools only ever writes
# this file at the root anyway.
/MANIFEST

